National emblem — public/logos/krds.svg

public/logos/krds.svg is the Republic of Korea government symbol
(정부상징), not a product logo. Its terms differ from the brand
logos above.

  - Governed by 「정부기에 관한 공고」 (2016-03-29, 대통령공고 제264호)
  - krds.go.kr states its materials are published under KOGL Type 1
    (공공누리 제1유형 — attribution)
  - Whether the symbol itself falls within that scope is NOT verified
  - Treated here as identification / reference only

Do not reuse it as an identifier for any non-government product.

Takedown requests:
  - Open a Takedown request issue using the
    "⚖️ 삭제(Takedown) 요청" template (label: legal/takedown), or
  - Use this repository's Private Vulnerability Reporting if the
    matter is sensitive or legal:
    https://github.com/CaesiumY/ko-design-md/security/advisories/new

See docs/TAKEDOWN.md for how takedown requests are handled.

Preview asset inventory — brand imagery embedded in mockups

Preview mockups are drawn in CSS and inline SVG. Where one embeds a
brand's own artwork instead, the file lives beside that preview and is
listed here. Entries are indented four spaces so the logo inventory
below stays the single list that public/logos/ is checked against.

The list is empty. Every preview is drawn entirely in CSS and inline
SVG. Four 당근 service icons under public/preview/seed-design/assets/
were the only exception; they were replaced with that preview's own
SVG sprite and the directory is gone. The section stays so the next
embedded asset has a declared home, and so the test that keeps this
list in sync with public/preview/*/assets/ still has an anchor.

